        <!-- ===== Legend ===== -->
        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;rounded=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;Edge footprint:&lt;/b&gt; Rust SDK (&amp;lt;0.5 MB runtime) + statically linked ONNX Runtime; measured peak RSS 20–30 MB — fits the 64 MB budget&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Offline-first:&lt;/b&gt; local inference continues during outages; escalations queue (1,000, drop-oldest) and drain FIFO with original timestamps&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Escalation cooldown:&lt;/b&gt; repeats of the same anomaly type suppressed for 300 s — caps a persistent fault at ~288 escalations/day/device&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cloud agent:&lt;/b&gt; Strands agent on AgentCore compares the window against 7-day DynamoDB baselines and publishes severity/cause/action/evidence" vertex="1">
